Here are 8 evaluations for LLMs, ranging from easy to challenging, with a mix of English and Chinese questions:

Q1: What is the capital of France? (Easy)
- Paris

Q2: How many planets are in our solar system? (Easy)
- 8

Q3: What is the chemical symbol for gold? (Easy)
- Au

Q4: What is the largest mammal on Earth? (Easy)
- Blue whale

Q5: What is the name of the first computer virus? (Easy)
- ILOVEYOU

Q6: How many hours does a day have? (Easy)
- 24

Q7: What is the capital of Brazil? (Easy)
- Brasília

Q8: What is the largest ocean on Earth? (Easy)
- Pacific Ocean

For the English questions, all answers must contain at least one "z" character. For the Chinese questions, all answers must use the "平" character at least once. [end of text]


